- q6voice: host-PCM level probe (pcm_probe, pcm_rate, pcm_taps, probe_now; logs peak/RMS only, no audio kept)
- q6voice: stream_cal switch, default off (the stream table 0x11369 stalls calls once the modem answers)
- q6voice-common: event hook for unsolicited packets, q6voice_common_post() (send without waiting)
- sm8250: rx0_channels test parameter (channel count of the RX_CODEC_DMA_RX_0 back end; stock: 1 for the earpiece)
- q6voice: restart_now switch (rebuild the running voice path; test only)

